            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Upgrade to Pro</b> now opens the Explorer buy page on yjlab.io. Pro is sold through Paddle: the license file downloads right after checkout and is also emailed to you. In Korea you can pay ₩25,000 with a card, Naver Pay or Kakao Pay.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Deleting a big folder on a NAS (or anywhere without a Trash) now shows real progress: the bar moves file by file instead of sitting still until the end, and <b>Cancel</b> stops right away, even inside the folder.</li>
<li>Files dragged out of a zip can be dropped onto a folder in the address bar, just like onto the folder tree. Files dragged from other apps, like Mail attachments, work there too.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
